note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
note trap.om: concatenated after sha512.om. A length one past the capacity (65537) must trap 3,
note so this program exits 103 (trap 3 -> exit 100 + 3) and never reaches ret 0.
fn main to int
m = new uchar 65536 0
o = new uchar 64 0
s512hash m 65537 o
ret 0
end
